                "publishedAt": null,
                "snippet": "Prior Authorization Policy\n1. Purpose\nPrior authorization (PA) is the payer’s approval, obtained before a service is delivered, that the service is covered and medically necessary. A claim for a service that needed approval and did not have it is denied, and the denial code is “Prior authorization missing”. This policy lists the services that need approval, the time a payer has to decide, and who at Riverside Health Network does what.",
